  "worked_solution": "To evaluate our multivariable function at the point $(\\pi ,-1),$ we substitute $x=\\pi $ and $y=-1$ into the function expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(\\pi ,-1) & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(xy)}{y+1}{|}_{(\\pi ,-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(\\pi \\cdot 1)}{-1+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{-1}{0},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is undefined.",
